      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No tiene sentido terminar el combate sin que\nme hayas enseñado a Mega-Medicham. ¡Otra vez!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mega-Medicham es tan genial que ahora\nmi cabeza se inundó de inspiración!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De hecho, estaba pensando que...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500200068006500630068006F002C0020006500730074006100620061002000700065006E00730061006E0064006F0020007100750065002E002E002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Pokémon suelen ir en sus Pokébolas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007300750065006C0065006E00200069007200200065006E002000730075007300200050006F006B00E90062006F006C00610073002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y las cajas tienen un diseño así futurista\ny medio cibernético.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020006C00610073002000630061006A006100730020007400690065006E0065006E00200075006E0020006400690073006500F1006F00200061007300ED0020006600750074007500720069007300740061000A00790020006D006500640069006F002000630069006200650072006E00E9007400690063006F002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Prepárense, gente de Ciudad Luminalia!\n¡No lo van a poder creer!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000720065007000E100720065006E00730065002C002000670065006E0074006500200064006500200043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610021000A00A1004E006F0020006C006F002000760061006E0020006100200070006F006400650072002000630072006500650072002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se agregaron los colores de lentes de contacto\nCíborg y Pokébola.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006500200061006700720065006700610072006F006E0020006C006F007300200063006F006C006F0072006500730020006400650020006C0065006E00740065007300200064006500200063006F006E0074006100630074006F000A004300ED0062006F007200670020007900200050006F006B00E90062006F006C0061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias por todo! Lo prometo: a partir de ahora,\nvoy a salir yo a buscar más megaevoluciones.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
